纳，补充商业医疗保险；\\n- 弹性工作制，双休，带薪年假 + 法定节假日；\\n- 提供技术图书报销、学习培训补贴及内部技术分享会；\\n- 轻松开放的团队氛围，定期团建与节日福利。\', \'job_title\': \'python初级工程师\', \'resume\': 3, \'selected_types\': [\'hr\', \'technical\', \'scenario\', \'behavioral\', \'project_deep_dive\', \'leader\']}','POST',NULL,'177.10.0.1','Edge 152.0.0','2000','Windows 10','{\'code\': 2000, \'msg\': \'创建成功\'}',1,1),(655,NULL,NULL,'1','2026-08-20 13:19:34.149302','2026-08-20 13:19:34.079267','面试会话表','/api/interview/6/proctor_events/','{\'event_type\': \'face_lost\', \'detail\': {\'duration_ms\': 5024.300000000003}}','POST',NULL,'177.10.0.1','Edge 152.0.0','2000','Windows 10','{\'code\': 2000, \'msg\': \'已记录\'}',1,1),(656,NULL,NULL,'1','2026-08-20 13:19:39.328534','2026-08-20 13:19:39.259101','面试会话表','/api/interview/6/proctor_events/','{\'event_type\': \'face_lost\', \'detail\': {\'duration_ms\': 5020.199999999997}}','POST',NULL,'177.10.0.1','Edge 152.0.0','2000','Windows 10','{\'code\': 2000, \'msg\': \'已记录\'}',1,1),(657,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-20 13:19:44.063681','2026-08-20 13:19:44.063709','面试会话表',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL),(658,NULL,NULL,'1','2026-08-20 13:19:52.380741','2026-08-20 13:19:52.307919','面试会话表','/api/interview/6/proctor_events/','{\'event_type\': \'fullscreen_exit\', \'detail\': {}}','POST',NULL,'177.10.0.1','Edge 152.0.0','2000','Windows 10','{\'code\': 2000, \'msg\': \'已记录\'}',1,1),(659,NULL,NULL,'1','2026-08-20 13:20:07.538075','2026-08-20 13:19:59.797710','面试会话表','/api/interview/6/speech/transcribe/','{}','POST',NULL,'177.10.0.1','Edge 152.0.0','2000','Windows 10','{\'code\': 2000, \'msg\': \'转写成功\'}',1,1),(660,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-20 13:20:20.540671','2026-08-20 13:20:20.540705','面试会话表',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL),(661,NULL,NULL,'1','2026-08-20 13:20:23.179388','2026-08-20 13:20:23.121902','面试会话表','/api/interview/6/speech/synthesize_stream/','{\'text\': \'张凌峰你好，很高兴认识你。\', \'voice\': \'\'}','POST',NULL,'177.10.0.1','Edge 152.0.0','400','Windows 10','{\'co