376466','single','慢查询日志的用途是（　）','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"记录执行超时阈值的 SQL 便于优化\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"记录所有用户操作\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"审计登录\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"备份数据\"}]','[\"A\"]',1.0,'慢查询日志定位性能瓶颈 SQL',1,'[\"数据库\", \"优化\"]','python','','[]',3000,256,1,NULL,'考点整理'),(752,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-19 16:10:04.388539','2026-08-19 16:10:04.388565','single','MySQL 中查看表结构的命令是（　）','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"DESC 表名\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"SHOW DATABASES\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"USE 库\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"FLUSH TABLES\"}]','[\"A\"]',1.0,'DESC/SHOW COLUMNS 查看表结构',1,'[\"数据库\", \"SQL\"]','python','','[]',3000,256,1,NULL,'考点整理'),(753,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-19 16:10:04.402077','2026-08-19 16:10:04.402102','single','MySQL 中更改表名或列定义使用（　）','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"ALTER TABLE\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"UPDATE TABLE\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"MODIFY TABLE\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"CHANGE TABLE\"}]','[\"A\"]',1.0,'ALTER TABLE 修改表结构',1,'[\"数据库\", \"DDL\"]','python','','[]',3000,256,1,NULL,'考点整理'),(754,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-19 16:10:04.414032','2026-08-19 16:10:04.414058','single','SQL 中约束 NOT NULL 表示（　）','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"列值不能为空\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"列值唯一\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"列值默认 0\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"列可空\"}]','[\"A\"]',1.0,'NOT NULL 禁止空值',1,'[\"数据库\", \"约束\"]','python','','[]',3000,256,1,NULL,'考点整理'),(755,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-19 16:10:04.433117','2026-08-19 16:10:04.433146','single','UNIQUE 约束与主键的区别是（　）','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"UNIQUE 允许一个 NULL，主键不允许 NULL\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"两者完全相同\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"UNIQUE 必须非空\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"主键可重复\"}]','[\"A\"]',1.0,'主键唯一非空；UNIQUE 允许 NULL（MySQL 多个 NULL）',2,'[\"数据库\", \"约束\"]','python','','[]',3000,256,1,NULL,'考点整理'),(756,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-19 16:10:04.447178','2026-08-19 16:10:04.447208','single','数据库设计中的反规范化（冗余）主要为了（　）','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\":