ckerfile 构建。',1,'[\"运维\", \"Docker\"]','python','','[]',3000,256,1,NULL,'2026高频考点整理（联网调研+自动推理）'),(915,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-19 16:10:06.608476','2026-08-19 16:10:06.608494','single','Docker Compose 的服务编排定义文件默认是？','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"docker-compose.yml\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"Dockerfile\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"package.json\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"kubeconfig\"}]','[\"A\"]',1.0,'docker-compose.yml 声明服务、网络、卷，docker compose up 一键启动。',1,'[\"运维\", \"Docker\"]','python','','[]',3000,256,1,NULL,'2026高频考点整理（联网调研+自动推理）'),(916,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-19 16:10:06.623355','2026-08-19 16:10:06.623370','single','查看 Kubernetes 集群中 Pod 列表的命令是？','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"kubectl get pods\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"docker ps\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"kubectl run\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"helm list\"}]','[\"A\"]',1.0,'kubectl get pods 查看 Pod 及状态；加 -n 指定命名空间。',1,'[\"运维\", \"Kubernetes\"]','python','','[]',3000,256,1,NULL,'2026高频考点整理（联网调研+自动推理）'),(917,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-19 16:10:06.636858','2026-08-19 16:10:06.636876','single','Deployment 修改镜像后触发滚动更新，常见命令是？','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"kubectl set image deployment/xx 容器=镜像\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"kubectl delete pod 全部\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"kubectl scale --replicas=0\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"kubectl apply -f pod.yaml\"}]','[\"A\"]',1.0,'kubectl set image（或 edit/apply）更新镜像即触发滚动更新；也可 rollout restart 重建。',2,'[\"运维\", \"Kubernetes\"]','python','','[]',3000,256,1,NULL,'2026高频考点整理（联网调研+自动推理）'),(918,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-19 16:10:06.650463','2026-08-19 16:10:06.650478','single','Jenkins 声明式流水线定义文件是？','[{\"key\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Jenkinsfile\"}, {\"key\": \"B\", \"text\": \"pipeline.xml\"}, {\"key\": \"C\", \"text\": \"build.sh\"}, {\"key\": \"D\", \"text\": \"docker-compose.yml\"}]','[\"A\"]',1.0,'Jenkinsfile 用 Groovy 声明式语法定义 stages/steps，实现流水线即代码。',1,'[\"运维\", \"CI/CD\"]','python','','[]',3000,256,1,NULL,'2026高频考点整理（联网调研+自动推理）'),(919,NULL,NUL